<title>MALAYSIA: MALAYSIA STOCKS - Factors to watch - March 10.</title>
<headline>MALAYSIA STOCKS - Factors to watch - March 10.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are some of the main factors likely to affect Malaysian stocks on Monday:</p>
<p>* Stocks of the DRB-Hicom group to relist after being suspended since last Tuesday, following the death of group chairman Yahaya Ahmad. Analysts said they expected the shares to be weaker at the open and then recover in the afternoon. Together, the shares comprise around 10 percent of the weighting of the benchmark Composite Index.</p>
<p>* On Friday, the Kuala Lumpur Composite Index closed 1.37 points higher at 1,251.21.</p>
